# OpenTelemetry vulnerabilities - require OTel SDK v2 / NestJS 11 migration
# All are DoS-only (no data leak or RCE), affecting metrics/tracing endpoints

# Prometheus exporter DoS via malformed HTTP request
# Affects: @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node, exporter-prometheus, sdk-node
# Fix requires: >= 0.217.0 (SDK v2 only)
CVE-2026-44902

# Propagator-jaeger DoS via malformed HTTP header decoding
# Fix requires: >= 2.9.0 (SDK v2 only)
CVE-2026-59892

# brace-expansion DoS vulnerabilities - only present in bundled npm (removed from production image)
# Cannot override without breaking ESLint 8's minimatch dependency
CVE-2026-13149
CVE-2026-14257
CVE-2026-69152
